---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import instagramIcon from "./../assets/instagram-white-icon.png";
---

<Layout>
  <div class="centeredContainer">
    <div class="titleContainer">
      <div class="ccnycTitle">CCNYC</div>
      <div class="ccnycSubtitle">creative coding nyc</div>
    </div>
    <div class="missionStatement">
      <div class="missionStatementTitle">Mission statement</div>
      Mission statement TKTK. Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing
      elit. Donec sagittis maximus consectetur. Duis tincidunt leo eget sapien fringilla
      condimentum. Cras mattis ex vitae nibh sodales aliquet. Proin lorem dolor,
      lobortis ut ullamcorper vitae, maximus quis magna. Maecenas lacus nulla, egestas
      in mattis a, iaculis quis arcu. Vestibulum nibh arcu, elementum ut risus id,
      cursus aliquet mi. Pellentesque vitae mollis leo. Etiam at urna venenatis,
      tristique odio non, tincidunt quam.
    </div>
    <div class="socialsContainer">
      <a
        href="https://www.instagram.com/creativecodingnyc/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noreferrer"
      >
        <Image src={instagramIcon} alt="Instagram icon" class="instaIcon" />
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .centeredContainer {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .titleContainer {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }

  .ccnycTitle {
    font-size: 4.5rem;
    font-family: "Tanker", monospace;
  }

  .ccnycSubtitle {
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .missionStatement {
    width: clamp(300px, 60%, 800px);
  }

  .missionStatementTitle {
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--theme-gray);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .socialsContainer {
    margin-top: 50px;
  }

  .instaIcon {
    width: 40px;
    height: unset;
  }
</style>
